Put the six lines this program prints in order.

```python
def log(tag):
    print('factory', tag)
    def deco(fn):
        print('decorate', tag)
        def wrapper(*args):
            print('call', tag)
            return fn(*args)
        return wrapper
    return deco

@log('outer')
@log('inner')
def f():
    pass

f()
```
